{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_06_end","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":14,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_06_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-6","storyName":"倒带独白","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"卢西恩道出莫伊拉为姐姐劳拉复仇的每一步，莫伊拉也在他的步步紧逼之下发现她并不存在于劳拉的人生之中。而此时莫伊拉安装的破坏装置生效，地块撞向天灾，剧组人员的性命危在旦夕，一切无法回头。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_06_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_06","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":12,"next":14,"characters":["莫伊拉","卢西恩","格蕾塔","慌乱的工作人员","害怕的工作人员","倒霉的场工"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_sys_rglk1phantomcastle_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/rogue_1/m_sys_rglk1phantomcastle_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_bg_62_g10_dormitory.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#13$2","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"看来你在格蕾塔女士解散剧组之后给出的各种选择里，选择了侦探，卢西恩先生。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"不用虚张声势。我知道，你并不害怕我点破它。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"如果能让更多人知道劳拉坠亡的真相以及剧组成员的所作所为，你甚至会在合适的时机主动暴露自己。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......但不是现在。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"都结束了，莫伊拉。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你一直隐藏得很好，单纯的身份和无辜的外表是很理想的掩护。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"几乎每次凶案发生时，你都与蒂比在一起，那位场景喷绘师对你很信任，她为你提供了不在场证明......哪怕你曾中途离开。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"现在想来，剧组发生的每起“意外”，都或多或少与你有关。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"道尔顿死于被替换的道具刀，原先的道具组长被辞退，你顺理成章接手他的工作，获得了更多作案的机会。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"第二起“意外”......","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"——谢莉走入冷库。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"不，在那之前她已起了杀心，只是未能成功。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"格蕾塔女士，还记得吗？谢莉小姐曾因陷入幻觉耽误了拍摄。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"当她僵在原地无法动弹的时候，沉重的货箱从天而降......","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#3$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你救下了谢莉，莫伊拉仅凭一人之力拉住了货箱的绳索，避免你们受伤......","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"那可不是好心的顺手之劳。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"当时所有人都被谢莉小姐的行动吸引，极少有人会注意到空中悬吊的货箱......","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"更别提第一时间出现在绳索的另一端。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"只有在绳索上做手脚的人，才能做出如此迅速的反应......","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#10$2","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9F/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"也正是这次杀人未遂让“谢莉小姐会被幻觉影响”成为剧组人人皆知的事实，于是你顺水推舟......","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我知道她最深的噩梦。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"她把我误认成劳拉姐姐，对我吐露了罪恶的秘密......","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#15$2","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"但直到最后，她都没向姐姐忏悔，反倒开始责怪姐姐的逾矩......她该死。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"至于玛丽昂和迈克尔......","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"迈克尔只当我是个任人支使的无辜女孩，他猜不到我才是要向他索命的凶手，连偷偷逃离地块这样性命攸关的事也委托我帮忙。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#15$2","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"而玛丽昂甚至认为自己丝毫不需要为当年的事情负责，她更该死！","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"逃？一个都逃不掉！","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你们知道吗，姐姐承受了那么多痛苦与恶意，可她只字不提，只说自己在剧组里收获了多少经验与快乐......","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"当我忧心自己无法胜任道具师工作时，当我在剧组受到排挤偷偷掉眼泪时......她都会拿自己举例子安慰我，鼓励我......","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#16$2","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"但直到她过世之后，我才知道，你们提供给她的究竟是哪种待遇！","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E5/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"......","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#15$2","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"格蕾塔，而你现在看着我的眼神里竟然充满了......疑惑？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#17$2","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你难道忘了自己是怎样买通警方和媒体，压下姐姐的死，把意外变成电影中亦真亦假的戏，让她死后都不得安宁的吗！","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-17$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"不，莫伊拉。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"格蕾塔女士并未遗忘自己的所作所为，她只是在怀疑你的真实身份。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#7$2","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"身份？剧组的道具师，不起眼的札拉克，犯下累累罪行的复仇者......","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#4$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"劳拉，并没有妹妹。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......她从不存在于你的人生。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#15$2","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你在......说什么？","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"这又是哪种逼问的手段？","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"五年前的事故之后，我曾给劳拉的家人发放了一笔抚恤金。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"为了保证劳拉的家庭成员，甚至是远亲都不会向外透露她已死的真相，我雇人仔细调查了她的家庭情况。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"卢西恩告诉我他推理出的真相后，我一度难以置信，所以再次对照了劳拉的家庭成员名单......","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"很遗憾......里面并没有“莫伊拉”。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#16$2","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......你撒谎！","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E5/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"关于你身上发生的一切，我知道该如何解释。但你需要花时间接受它。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"放下那把匕首，莫伊拉。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"它本不该属于你。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#13$2","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#14$2","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"放下......？","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"已经来不及了。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":103},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":104},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":105},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":107},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_recorderglitch","volume":"1","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":110},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":111},{"type":"charslot","id":112},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#3$1","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"发生什么了！","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#7$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":120},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"charslot","id":123},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_bg_62_g11_dormitory_corridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":126},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":127},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.3","id":128},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_sandfall_01","layer":"1","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_audience_chaos","volume":"1","id":131},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"e","fadetime":"2","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","bstart":"0.9","bend":"1","posfrom":"-200,30","posto":"0,30","duration":"0.8","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.8","duration":"0","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","bstart":"0.9","bend":"1","posfrom":"-200,30","posto":"0,30","duration":"0.8","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.8","duration":"0","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,30","posto":"200,30","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,30","posto":"200,30","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","bstart":"0.9","bend":"1","posfrom":"200,30","posto":"0,30","duration":"0.8","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.8","duration":"0","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","bstart":"0.9","bend":"1","posfrom":"200,30","posto":"0,30","duration":"0.8","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.8","duration":"0","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,30","posto":"-200,30","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,30","posto":"-200,30","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":152},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"r","id":153},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"1.5","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌乱的工作人员","text":"救命啊！怎么突然地震了！","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌乱的工作人员","text":"是不是地块撞上什么东西了？","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害怕的工作人员","text":"早知道白天离开这个鬼地方就好了......呜......到底发生了什么......","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":163},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"1","id":165},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":166},{"type":"text","text":"从房间涌出的剧组成员挤满了走廊，每个人都对现在的状况毫无头绪。","id":167},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩的影子穿过咒骂、抱怨、哀叹、祈祷的人群，来到走廊尽头，向窗户外看去。","id":168},{"type":"dialog","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#7$1","duration":"1","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"害怕的工作人员","text":"你们有没有觉得......地块越开越快了？！","id":175},{"type":"dialog","id":176},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":177},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"2","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"charslot","id":181},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_bg_62_g6_proproom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":182},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":183},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","volume":"1","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorknob","volume":"1","id":186},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$2","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":190},{"type":"charslot","id":191},{"type":"text","text":"莫伊拉锁上了门。","id":192},{"type":"text","text":"她不清楚那个叫卢西恩的家伙会不会追过来，追过来又还要多久......","id":193},{"type":"text","text":"房间在剧烈摇晃，她知道自己安装的破坏装置已经生效了——","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"驾驶室被炸毁，引擎功率被锁死在了最高的档位，航线被固定，这座蓝卡坞的拍摄地块正在加速奔向本就不远的天灾......一往无前。","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"再过几个小时他们才会发现自己直面风暴的噩运......不，是审判。","id":196},{"type":"text","text":"这个剧组的绝大多数人，都需要为五年前的那起意外接受拷问......","id":197},{"type":"text","text":"为她的姐姐。","id":198},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$2","id":200},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$2","id":202},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":203},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":204},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":205},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":206},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":208,"musicid":1},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_bg_62_g10_dormitory.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":210},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"劳拉，并没有妹妹。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......她从不存在于你的人生。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":216},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":217},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"charslot","id":220},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_bg_62_g6_proproom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":221},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$2","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"怎、怎么会......","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":228},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":229},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":230},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_weapons_drop","volume":"1","id":231},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"charslot","id":234},{"type":"background","id":235},{"type":"text","text":"莫伊拉喃喃不停，她在道具间的杂物堆里翻找着，终于，她将那个老式录像机摆好，从贴身的口袋掏出了一卷录像带......","id":236},{"type":"text","text":"一卷她看过无数遍的录像带。","id":237},{"type":"text","text":"她按下了放映钮。","id":238},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_062cg_tvnoise","layer":"1","id":240},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_62_i04_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":241},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":242},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":245},{"type":"text","text":"一张女孩的笑脸出现在了屏幕上。","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......劳拉。","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......我的姐姐。你明明，这么、这么真实......","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你大笑的时候只有左边的脸颊有梨涡，你的瞳孔是浅绿色的，你的眼睛很大，你看着我的时候，总是那么温柔。","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你可以半分钟削整个苹果而皮一点都不断，你会在开心的时候吹清亮的口哨，你会用源石技艺结出小冰花来充当发卡......","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你告诉我自己在蓝卡坞的经历，出演的第一个角色在最后的成片里被剪辑得只剩下三秒的镜头......","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你告诉我自己又多争取到了几场戏份，虽然有几个家伙颇有微词，但剧组的大家还是很照顾你的......","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你告诉我哪怕是从连录像机都买不到的小镇子来到蓝卡坞，很多东西都要从零开始学，很多别人容易得到的机遇对我们来说都很遥远......","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"也不应该灰心丧气。","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你从来都不会提及自己挨了多少欺负，受了多少委屈，你总是绘声绘色地讲起蓝卡坞的朝阳，满怀自信地憧憬着未来......","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你也有情绪低落的时候，即便那时你也只是说，夜深人静，看着天边的双月，会很想回家......","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你告诉我，我们很像，你会永远鼓励我支持我......","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我们从小——","id":258},{"type":"text","text":"莫伊拉突然停了下来。","id":259},{"type":"text","text":"她发疯似的摇着自己的脑袋，试图从记忆深处逼出更多的细节。","id":260},{"type":"text","text":"可她没法再往下说了，她发现自己有关劳拉的记忆，停留在了一个异常清晰的断点——","id":261},{"type":"text","text":"她们不曾小时候手牵着手在草地上奔跑，她们不曾在父母的歌声中相依着睡着......","id":262},{"type":"text","text":"更早之前，有关这个姐姐的画面，一片空白。","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":264},{"type":"dialog","id":265},{"type":"bgeffect","fade":"true","fadetime":"0.2","id":266},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","fadetime":"0.2","id":267},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":268},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0A/Avg_62_i04_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.2","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":270},{"type":"text","text":"录像带在此刻播放完毕，电视机的屏幕黑了下去。","id":271},{"type":"text","text":"莫伊拉看见了自己的脸。","id":272},{"type":"text","text":"眼泪在无声地流淌着。","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你从不曾存在于劳拉的人生......","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"劳拉也从不曾存在于你的人生......","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"可是、可是若真是这样......","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"莫伊拉，你还剩下什么？","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......你是谁？","id":278},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":280},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":281},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":282},{"type":"image","id":283},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0D/Avg_bg_62_g7_mobileplotstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"唉......凶案接连不断，凌晨又发生了原因不明的爆炸，到底怎么了......","id":286},{"type":"dialog","id":287},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":288},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":289},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":290},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":291,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":293},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#3$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"-0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"风怎么这么大？","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0A/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#1$1","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"哦对......按照计划，今天就是拍摄天灾的日子。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"霍汀站在外景大街上，由于靠近风暴，原本色彩鲜艳的背景墙上蒙上了一层灰。","id":300},{"type":"text","text":"她从未想过自己进到这个剧组后会有如此跌宕起伏的经历，她只想拍电影，至于成为电影中的人......她可受不了。","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#6$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"这就是......格蕾塔女士要拍的天灾......","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":304},{"type":"text","text":"之前，被当作谈资的灾难还是荒原上若隐若现的一个灰点。","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"现在，它已凝聚成一大片天幕似的风暴，让人移不开目光。","id":306},{"type":"text","text":"源石粉尘形成的小型风柱在地块的近端回旋......肉眼可见。","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#6$1","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"......不得不说，实在是，太、太壮观了......要是能在电影院里看到这样的场景......","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#4$1","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"大地保佑，我都倒了这么多次霉了，行行好，让我们的电影顺利拍完......","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"不......让我们顺利返回蓝卡坞主城区就行！拜托了！","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":313},{"type":"text","text":"地块以更加异常的声响和晃动回应了霍汀的祈祷。","id":314},{"type":"dialog","id":315},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"0.4","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":316},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"3","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#6$1","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"等等......这是怎么了！","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":321},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":322},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":323},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":324},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bodyfallvalley","volume":"1","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#5$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"啊——！","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-100","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":330},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","id":331},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":332},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","id":333},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":335},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tinnitus","volume":"1","id":336},{"type":"text","text":"霍汀曾不止一次想象，若自己真的身处天灾之下，会听到什么？","id":337},{"type":"text","text":"风声？爆炸声？受灾群众的嘶吼声？都不是。","id":338},{"type":"text","text":"是建筑墙面和金属结构像一只易拉罐一样，一点一点被踩扁、挤压的声音——","id":339},{"type":"text","text":"它将毫无还手之力的人类轻易推入极端的惶恐之中，让他们开始害怕自己的内脏、骨骼、血管也遭受同样的折磨。","id":340},{"type":"dialog","id":341},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_wind","layer":"1","id":342},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind_howling","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"wi","id":343},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0D/Avg_bg_62_g7_mobileplotstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","id":344},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"80","yTo":"-80","duration":"8","block":"false","id":345},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"3","id":346},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_dim_openeye","layer":"2","id":347},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"wi","fadetime":"2","id":348},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":349},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":350},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_equipment_collapse","volume":"1","id":351},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"0.6","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":352},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":353},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":354},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":355},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_bg_62_g8_mobileplotstreet_ruined.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"2","id":356},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"0","yTo":"-70","duration":"4","block":"false","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":358},{"type":"text","text":"浑浊的天幕倾轧着地块边缘，曾经出现在经典影片中的布景被狂风撕碎，扔到荒原之中。","id":359},{"type":"text","text":"霍汀移开倒在自己身上的支撑架，却发现自己的腿已经软得无法使上任何力气。","id":360},{"type":"text","text":"她怔怔地看着地块上发生的剧变，怀疑自己的眼睛。","id":361},{"type":"dialog","id":362},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothtrailground","volume":"1","id":363},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_bg_62_g8_mobileplotstreet_ruined.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","id":364},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"天......我们怎么离天灾这么近了！","id":366},{"type":"dialog","id":367},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"wi","fadetime":"2","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"bgeffect","id":370},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":371},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"background","id":373},{"type":"image","id":374}],"characters":["莫伊拉","卢西恩","格蕾塔","慌乱的工作人员","害怕的工作人员","倒霉的场工"]}